  "answer": "This feature has been requested many times before. Nothing has shipped, and no ticket in the archive reports it as implemented. Several of the requests were closed as duplicates of PowerToys#3442 (a media converter using ffmpeg) or PowerToys#9743 (a bulk Word-to-PDF converter). Please add a 👍 or any new use cases to #3442 instead of opening a new ticket. In the meantime, convert between document formats with the source app, for example Word's 'Save a copy' or 'Export as PDF'. For audio and video, use ffmpeg or VLC. For other conversions, use a dedicated tool such as the open-source File Converter (file-converter.org). Renaming a file's extension, for example from .zip to .exe, does not convert its contents. It usually produces a file that won't work. If you only want to rename extensions in bulk, PowerRename can do that."
